won't be able to resolve the disagreement. 
 His "Design Policy of the Excluded Middle" urges
avoiding systems whose moral standing is unclear.
Peter Singer has extended his utilitarian framework to digital minds, stating: "If we do create conscious AI, that
conscious being has interests, an interest in not feeling pain." 
 He sees no in-principle reason
